NECROMANCER — CLASS GUIDE (PRIVATE PLAYTEST)
Necromancers use magic to bind undead servants to their will.
Choose Necromancer at character creation. Mage combat and training rules
are temporarily used; Necromancer identity is saved separately.

First skill: raise skeleton (8 mana, one untimed undead servant).
The servant inherits the HP and MP of the defeated monster. It can be
healed using healing magic and compatible items. See help raise skeleton.
Use skills to check your current class eligibility.

Physical corpse selection, durable pet persistence, additional skills,
and Graveburst (proposed rebirth skill) are not enabled yet.
